# Interns Project Overview

This is an npm workspaces monorepo for learning frontend and backend.

## Apps

- `apps/intersfrontend` — React + Vite (UI in the browser)
- `apps/intersbackend` — Node.js + Express (API)

## Where to change code

- UI / React work → `apps/intersfrontend`
- API / server work → `apps/intersbackend`
- Do not mix FE and BE concerns in one file. Keep them separate.

## How to run (from repo root)

- `npm install` once at the root
- `npm run dev:backend` → http://localhost:3000
- `npm run dev:frontend` → http://localhost:5173 (open this in the browser)
- For full-stack work, run both (two terminals)

## Stack rules

- Frontend: JavaScript + React + Vite (not Next.js; not TypeScript unless the team decides later)
- Backend: JavaScript + Express
- Prefer simple, readable code over new libraries or patterns

## Linting

- From the root: `npm run lint`
